# Unholy Alliance — a "Play Deck" folder deck installed by Duels of the Planeswalkers (1998): a ready-made
# player deck that shipped in the expansion's files but was not offered in-game (the precon
# page: "users would need to open the game's files and move them into a different directory").
# designer: Tim McCracken and Alan Denham (MicroProse, largely the Quality Assurance team — precon page)
# colours: W/B
# source: ../mage-go/data/preconstructed_decks.yaml shandalar.player_decks.other ["Unholy
#   Alliance"] [Tier 3 — mage-go's transcription of the expansion's Play Deck files]
# cross-check: https://mtg.wiki/page/Shandalar_Player_Decks_(Other) — "Unholy Alliance"
#   [Tier-web — agrees card for card]
# cross-check: a screenshot of the original .DCK file is on the wiki page (files.mtg.wiki Unholy_Alliance_DOTP.png)
# group: Other MicroProse decks
